1) As per extant RBI guidelines and in compliance with the applicable Accounting Standard (AS) - 17, 'Segment Reporting', reportable segments are identified as Treasury, Corporate/Wholesale Banking, Retail Banking and other Banking operations. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
