 &lt;BR&gt; 
3) In determining 'Segment Results', the funds transfer price mechanism adopted by the Bank has been used. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
4) Results, Revenue and Capital Employed of International Operations through GIFT City are included in Corporate/Wholesale Banking segment. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
5) As per RBI circular dated April 7, 2022 , Digital Banking to be reported as part of Retail Banking. Digital Banking Units are not yet operational in IDB1 Bank Ltd. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
6) Previous period's figures have been regrouped/ reclassified, wherever necessary to make them comparable with current period.</in-capmkt:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock></xbrli:xbrl>